The objective part 8 is some text that varies. The objective part 8 is "n, take a trip south. Next, go east. Following that, attempt to go north. With that over with, attempt to go north. Okay, and then, make an effort to venture north. After that, attempt to go to the ea".
The objective part 9 is some text that varies. The objective part 9 is "st. If you can manage that, attempt to head east. Then, head north. After that, travel east. After that, go north. After that, try to head west. Then, travel south. Then, make an effort to go west. Th".
